# Text files are stored with LF line endings. Binary files are never converted: a PDF whose line
# endings get rewritten on checkout is corrupted (the demo's security-policy.pdf must stay byte-exact).
* text=auto
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.mp4 binary
